{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"109424a062f40fd480ff662bbb05641568cc42644bbe56130821004548a0bd9f","ja":"真夏の女子トーク～3通目～","zh":"盛夏女子聊天～第3封～","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f97790257c623ccd962c9b389d9e6d7011cc6b817bd38d3e6fb1f9a9c73d4e8a","ja":"それでは、最後のメールです。『みなさんに質問です。\n今後の夢や目標はありますか？』ということです。","zh":"那么，这是最后一封邮件了。『向大家提一个问题。\n今后有什么梦想或目标吗？』就是这样。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"eb30c712c01b160b812bbfbb1a0f5e25cb9a5885ea8d929766034698e77ed17b","ja":"なかなか難しい質問ね。まあ、私の目標は……\n昨日よりもセクシーで、アダルティになることね！","zh":"这问题还真难回答呢。不过，我的目标是……要比昨天更性感、更成熟！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cacd11bb832d08cbd4519027aa1d6ef1c5a159ea1924f0f69fd1d82af679d1f6","ja":"そのためにも自分磨きを頑張っていくつもりよ。\nこれからの私に期待しててね、うふふっ♪","zh":"为此我也会努力提升自己的。\n对今后的我满怀期待吧，呵呵♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"420da2802da81e3e768051200652d1dfefab953390fe7f1268554d96e7498c9e","ja":"私は、多くの人を感動させられるようになりたいです。\nまだまだ未熟だし、遠い道のりかもしれませんけど。","zh":"我想成为能让很多人感动的人。\n我还远远不够成熟，这可能是一条漫长的道路。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c22fc0d6e12be32158dd98bb264920aba77c1fb7c997b4d12273020820b2d195","ja":"今は様々なことに挑戦して、自分を成長させて……\nいつかは！　なんて。","zh":"现在正在挑战各种事情，让自己成长……\n总有一天！之类的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"11c4dd5bd38efe4c930327987c736c54015a51b4159816eb804eac910541506f","ja":"ステキだね、琴葉ちゃん。それに比べて私なんて……。\n全然成長してないちんちくりんで。でも……。","zh":"真棒啊，琴叶。相比之下，我……。\n完全没长大的小不点。但是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1e4880a277118eb37d9da61d0039a55a210d2833f085a49ca476556a372f996c","ja":"みんなと活動して、少しは前に進みたいって思います。\nだから、頑張るのを頑張ることが、私の目標かな。","zh":"想和大家一起活动，至少能前进一点。\n所以，为了努力而努力，就是我的目标吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"84bd85ed71ed3604cbc47f8b1e3f83a836c2ef606db651b82c41a35cb155bf89","ja":"最後は真美だね！　真美は、毎日楽しく過ごすかなー。\n遊んで、レッスンして、ボンノスケに水あげて……。","zh":"最后是真美呢！真美每天都会过得很开心吧。\n玩耍、练习、给ボンノスケ浇水……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f489213586dcf259a4156604272dda9ca4fd5bfe218d6eb58f1753aa2e1d6e82","ja":"なんだかんだでトップアイドルになってるってカンジ！\nどうどう？　人生セッケン、カンペキっしょ♪","zh":"总觉得到头来还是成了顶级偶像的感觉！\n怎么样？人生肥皂，完美无缺吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"dbfc95a83ab599b8eedd316147c659307d0a9b6015cecf5470bce42e3be125e2","ja":"人生石鹸……もしかして、人生設計のことかしら？\n道のりはどうあれ、最後はそこに行きつくわね。","zh":"人生石鹸……难道是指人生规划吗？\n不管过程如何，最后都会走到那里呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"84b70e3ec1d74db8fc83d4b2380cd3b5111daf0f281b9f0f1600765045925811","ja":"そうですね！　トップアイドル目指して、\nみんなで切磋琢磨しながら、高め合っていきたいです！","zh":"是啊！为了成为顶尖偶像，\n大家一起切磋琢磨，共同进步吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"73fa1485079fc9eb0c4ea0f085395303195a5de4ab60acf7525b648aeaaba166","ja":"すごく熱い言葉ね、琴葉ちゃん♪\nうふふっ、お姉さんも負けてられないわ。","zh":"真是非常热烈的话呢，琴叶♪\n呵呵，姐姐也不能输呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"d0f880e6f0fd56fb39e62d20c333ca9fe296a74ca5c46f06a17851ce6534cb05","ja":"……あら、そろそろ番組も終わりの時間みたいね。\nそれじゃあ、今日の女子トークはお開きってことで。","zh":"……啊，节目也差不多到结束的时间了呢。\n那么，今天的女生聊天就到此为止吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_926.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"e148e3ff1263f798aad511609f29f00f42db2532df6f2fc2423ef2db7b499be4","ja":"みなさん、最後まで見てくれてありがとうござい\nました！　また、お会いしましょう！","zh":"大家，感谢您观看到最后！期待再次与您相见！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
